## Summary

**Cytonex is a Priority candidate.** It meets every major criterion without triggering any kill conditions:

- ✅ **In-vitro diagnostics** (hematology instruments + captive reagents)  
- ✅ **Recurring revenue model** (64% consumables + service, well above 50% threshold)  
- ✅ **Temporary price pressure** (one-off product line charge during planned transition; new product on schedule)  
- ✅ **Profitable and leveraged appropriately** (17% EBITDA margin, 2.6x net debt)  
- ✅ **Favorable ownership structure** (PE fund holder openly receptive to offers)  
- ✅ **No regulatory red flags**

This is precisely the profile the thesis seeks: a solid operator in a good market suffering a temporary valuation discount, with a clear liquidity path and room for operational value creation under private ownership.
